request.description:
## Projects page (`GET /projects`)

**Auth:** 🔓 Public. No token needed.

**Rate limit:** `public-pages` 120 / min per IP.

Paginated, fixed page size of **12** (no `per_page`).

### Query params

| Param | Rules |
|---|---|
| `page` | optional, integer, min 1 (default 1) |
| `service` | optional, string, slug of an **active** service. Unknown or inactive slug → 422. Projects with no service only appear when no filter is sent |
| `lang` | optional, `ar` or `en` (falls back to `Accept-Language`, then `ar`) |

### Success: `200 OK`

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "status_code": 200,
  "message": "OK",
  "data": {
    "settings": { "footer_description": "...", "phone": "...", "whatsapp": "...", "email": "...", "address": "...", "map_url": "...", "working_hours": "...", "social": { "facebook": "...", "instagram": "...", "linkedin": "..." } },
    "sections": {
      "projects_banner": { "subtitle": null, "title": "...", "description": null, "image": "https://...", "video_url": null },
      "shared_bottom_cta": { "subtitle": "...", "title": "...", "description": "...", "image": "https://...", "video_url": null }
    },
    "filters": {
      "active": "web-development",
      "services": [ { "slug": "web-development", "title": "..." } ]
    },
    "projects": [
      {
        "id": 1, "slug": "talqa", "title": "...", "description": "...", "image": "https://...",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "mobile_app", "title": "...", "description": null,
            "images": ["https://..."], "technologies": ["Swift", "Kotlin"],
            "website_url": null, "app_store_url": "https://apps.apple.com/...", "google_play_url": "https://play.google.com/...",
            "apps": [ { "title": "...", "description": "..." } ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "meta": { "current_page": 1, "per_page": 12, "total": 1, "last_page": 1 }
}
```

`filters.active` is the applied slug or `null`. `filters.services` is always the full list. With no matching projects, `page=1` returns `200` and an empty list.

### Errors

**`404 NOT_FOUND`**: `page` beyond the last page

```json
{ "success": false, "status_code": 404, "message": "Resource not found.", "error_code": "NOT_FOUND", "errors": null, "meta": null }
```

**`422 VALIDATION_ERROR`**: bad `page` or unknown/inactive `service`

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "status_code": 422,
  "message": "The given data was invalid.",
  "error_code": "VALIDATION_ERROR",
  "errors": {
    "page": ["The page field must be an integer."],
    "service": ["The selected service is invalid."]
  },
  "meta": null
}
```

**`429 TOO_MANY_REQUESTS`**

```json
{ "success": false, "status_code": 429, "message": "Too many requests.", "error_code": "TOO_MANY_REQUESTS", "errors": null, "meta": { "retry_after": 30 } }
```

